ating input collections while preserving return types and error behavior.\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-3\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test_solution.py contains at least two unittest test methods that exercise the public API.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"test_solution.py\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"(?s)class\\\\\\\\s+\\\\\\\\w+\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\([^)]*unittest\\\\\\\\.TestCase[^)]*\\\\\\\\).*?(?:def\\\\\\\\s+test\\\\\\\\w*\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\(|def\\\\\\\\s+test\\\\\\\\w*\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\()[\\\\\\\\s\\\\\\\\S]*?(?:def\\\\\\\\s+test\\\\\\\\w*\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\()\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The solution module compiles successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The unittest discovery command completes successfully.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The relative paths solution.py and test_solution.py refer to files in the supplied task workspace; target files may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The existing signatures, return types, imports, compatibility surface, and detailed error behavior are discoverable from the supplied workspace and should be preserved; no specific signatures or legacy behavior were supplied in the request.\\\",\\\"The unittest suite is discoverable using the requested command python -m unittest discover -v.\\\",\\\"The test method check assumes tests are defined in a unittest.TestCase subclass and have names beginning with test; the requested minimum o